### Mechanic: Dynamic Friction & Mass Tuning
INTENT: read AttractionConstants.modifiers each frame to apply heat/luck/sleight-of-hand variables directly to the puck's friction, restitution, mass, and gravity factor.
PSEUDO:
  if not IsActive(puck) then return end
  heat = AttractionConstants.modifiers.heat or 0.0
  luck = AttractionConstants.modifiers.luck or 0.0
  sleight = AttractionConstants.modifiers.sleight_of_hand or 0.0
  base_friction = 0.5
  base_mass = 5.0
  base_restitution = 0.2
  base_gravity = 1.0
  final_friction = base_friction * (1.0 - heat) * (1.0 + sleight)
  final_mass = base_mass * (1.0 + luck)
  final_restitution = base_restitution * (1.0 + luck)
  final_gravity = base_gravity * (1.0 - heat)
  SetFriction(puck, final_friction)
  SetRestitution(puck, final_restitution)
  SetMass(puck, final_mass)
  SetGravityFactor(puck, final_gravity)
